{
  "_comment": "Single source for the prime directive 1 guard. Read by hooks/confirm-outbound.sh (Claude Code ask, Codex deny), adapters/pi/extensions/construct-guard.ts (pi confirm or block) and scripts/build-adapters.mjs (OpenCode permissions, Codex rules, Claude and Codex hook configs). Regexes are ERE and JS compatible: use plain spaces, never \\s, \\t or [[:space:]], since ERE and JS read those differently.",
